          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo Mzuri wa Israeli, ndesee msalabenyi idana, nesi diwone dirumirie.” Na awo weresulubishiroghe andwamweri nao, wikamsholia wokoni.",
          "type": "text",
